<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to auction 3.3 bln pesos of Cetes.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to auction 3.3 bln pesos of Cetes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said on Friday it would auction 3.3 billion pesos worth of Cetes at the primary auction on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    Terms	  Amount	   Fixed rates:</p>
<p>    28  days     900 million pesos  23.79 pct</p>
<p>    91  days     900 million pesos  23.45 pct</p>
<p>    182 days     900 million pesos  22.60 pct</p>
<p>    349 days     600 million pesos  20.73 pct</p>
<p>The central bank said it will also offer 500 million pesos worth of 364-day Bondes, and 500 million pesos worth of 728-day Bondes.</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom 525 7289559</p>
</text>
